B.a5O=s(["Indian Rummy","Indian Rummy","Indian Rummy","Indian Rummy","\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2\u30f3\u30fb\u30e9\u30df\u30fc","\u0907\u0902\u0921\u093f\u092f\u0928 \u0930\u092e\u0940","Indian Rummy","Indian Rummy"],t.s)
B.a8U=s(["\xc1brelo para elegir 42, Bloqueo, Domin\xf3 de robo, Tren Mexicano, Todos los cincos o Bergen, cada uno con sus propias reglas. Las capturas de abajo muestran el men\xfa y cada uno de sus juegos.","Ouvrez-le pour choisir 42, Bloqu\xe9, Pioche, Train mexicain, Tous les cinq ou Bergen, chacun avec ses propres r\xe8gles. Les captures ci-dessous montrent le menu et chacun de ses jeux.","\xd6ffne es, um 42, Block, Ziehen, Mexican Train, Alle F\xfcnfer oder Bergen mit jeweils eigenen Regeln zu w\xe4hlen. Die Screenshots unten zeigen das Men\xfc und jedes seiner Spiele.","Abra-o para escolher 42, Bloqueio, Compra, Trem Mexicano, Todos os cincos ou Bergen, cada um com suas pr\xf3prias regras. As capturas abaixo mostram o menu e cada um dos seus jogos.","\u958b\u304f\u3068\u3001\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u72ec\u81ea\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u6301\u306442\u3001\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3001\u30c9\u30ed\u30fc\u3001\u30e1\u30ad\u30b7\u30ab\u30f3\u30c8\u30ec\u30a4\u30f3\u3001\u30aa\u30fc\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30d6\u3001\u30d9\u30eb\u30b2\u30f3\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4e0b\u306e\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u3068\u305d\u306e\u4e2d\u306e\u5404\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0915\u0930 42, \u092c\u094d\u0932\u0949\u0915, \u0921\u094d\u0930\u093e, \u092e\u0948\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093f\u0915\u0928 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928, \u0911\u0932 \u092b\u093e\u0907\u0935\u094d\u0938 \u092f\u093e \u092c\u0930\u094d\u0917\u0947\u0928 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902, \u091c\u093f\u0928\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094d\u0930\u0940\u0928\u0936\u0949\u091f \u092e\u0947\u0928\u0942 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0939\u0930 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964","Buka untuk memilih 42, Blok, Tarik, Kereta Meksiko, Semua Lima, atau Bergen, masing-masing dengan aturannya sendiri. Tangkapan layar di bawah menunjukkan menu dan setiap game di dalamnya.","M\u1edf menu \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn 42, Ch\u1eb7n, R\xfat, T\xe0u Mexico, T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 s\u1ed1 n\u0103m ho\u1eb7c Bergen, m\u1ed7i tr\xf2 c\xf3 lu\u1eadt ri\xeang. \u1ea2nh ch\u1ee5p m\xe0n h\xecnh b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi l\xe0 menu v\xe0 t\u1eebng tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i trong \u0111\xf3."],t.s)
B.afu=s(["Domin\xf3 de bazas de Texas","Dominos \xe0 lev\xe9es du Texas","Texanisches Stichspiel mit Dominosteinen","Domin\xf3 de vazas do Texas","\u30c6\u30ad\u30b5\u30b9\u306e\u30c8\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u30c6\u30a4\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u30fb\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u0947\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u093e \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0915-\u091f\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino adu trik dari Texas","Domino \u0103n n\u01b0\u1edbc ki\u1ec3u Texas"],t.s)
B.amv=s(["Dos equipos de dos pujan en cada mano, quien puja m\xe1s alto elige el triunfo y las fichas de cuenta valen puntos extra. Cumple tu apuesta para ganar una marca.","Deux \xe9quipes de deux ench\xe9rissent \xe0 chaque donne, le plus offrant choisit l\u2019atout et les dominos de compte valent des points en plus. R\xe9alisez votre ench\xe8re pour gagner une marque.","Zwei Zweierteams bieten in jeder Runde, der H\xf6chstbietende bestimmt Trumpf, und die Z\xe4hlsteine bringen Extrapunkte. Erf\xfclle dein Gebot, um eine Marke zu gewinnen.","Duas duplas d\xe3o lances a cada m\xe3o, quem d\xe1 o maior lance escolhe o trunfo e as pedras de contagem valem pontos extras. Cumpra seu lance para ganhar uma marca.","2\u4eba1\u7d44\u306e2\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u6bce\u56de\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u3057\u3001\u6700\u9ad8\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u306e\u4eba\u304c\u5207\u308a\u672d\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u3001\u5f97\u70b9\u724c\u306f\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u70b9\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d3\u30c3\u30c9\u3092\u9054\u6210\u3059\u308b\u3068\u30de\u30fc\u30af\u3092\u7372\u5f97\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0926\u094b-\u0926\u094b \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0926\u094b \u091f\u0940\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u092a\u0930 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u090a\u0901\u091a\u0940 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0902\u092a \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0909\u0902\u091f \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0924\u093f\u0930\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0940 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0915 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dua tim berisi dua orang menawar di setiap ronde, penawar tertinggi memilih truf, dan kartu hitungan bernilai poin tambahan. Penuhi tawaranmu untuk memenangkan satu tanda.","Hai \u0111\u1ed9i hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7t gi\xe1 m\u1ed7i v\xe1n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ea3 gi\xe1 cao nh\u1ea5t ch\u1ecdn ch\u1ee7 b\xe0i, v\xe0 c\xe1c qu\xe2n t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ed9ng th\xeam. \u0110\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ec3 gi\xe0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ed1c."],t.s)
B.aiM=s(["Domin\xf3 cl\xe1sico de unir extremos","Dominos classiques o\xf9 l\u2019on assortit les bouts","Klassisches Domino: Enden anlegen","Domin\xf3 cl\xe1ssico de combinar as pontas","\u7aef\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u5b9a\u756a\u306e\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0915\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0915 \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino klasik mencocokkan ujung","Domino c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n n\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u"],t.s)
B.agB=s(["Juega una ficha que coincida con un extremo abierto de la l\xednea. No se roba: si no puedes jugar, pasas. Qu\xe9date sin fichas primero para ganar la ronda.","Posez un domino qui correspond \xe0 un bout libre de la ligne. On ne pioche pas : si vous ne pouvez pas jouer, vous passez. Videz votre main en premier pour gagner la manche.","Lege einen Stein an, der zu einem offenen Ende der Reihe passt. Es wird nicht gezogen: Wer nicht legen kann, passt. Wer zuerst alle Steine los ist, gewinnt die Runde.","Jogue uma pedra que combine com uma ponta aberta da linha. N\xe3o se compra: se n\xe3o puder jogar, voc\xea passa. Acabe com suas pedras primeiro para vencer a rodada.","\u5217\u306e\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306b\u5408\u3046\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u306f\u5f15\u3051\u305a\u3001\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u30d1\u30b9\u3067\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306b\u624b\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u5207\u308b\u3068\u30e9\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0932 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940: \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0924\u094d\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0902\u0921 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Mainkan kartu yang cocok dengan ujung terbuka barisan. Tidak ada menarik kartu: jika tidak bisa main, kamu lewat. Habiskan kartumu lebih dulu untuk memenangkan ronde.","\u0110\u1eb7t qu\xe2n kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf c\u1ee7a h\xe0ng. Kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1c th\xeam: n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xec b\u1ecf l\u01b0\u1ee3t. \u0110\xe1nh h\u1ebft qu\xe2n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng v\xf2ng."],t.s)
B.ajj=s(["Domin\xf3 de unir extremos con robo","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on assortit les bouts, avec pioche","Domino: Enden anlegen, mit Ziehen","Domin\xf3 de combinar as pontas, com compra","\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u3051\u308b\u7aef\u3064\u306a\u304e\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino mencocokkan ujung dengan menarik kartu","Domino n\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u c\xf3 b\u1ed1c qu\xe2n"],t.s)
B.akI=s(["Juega una ficha que coincida con un extremo abierto de la l\xednea y roba del pozo hasta que puedas. Qu\xe9date sin fichas primero para ganar la ronda.","Posez un domino qui correspond \xe0 un bout libre de la ligne, et piochez jusqu\u2019\xe0 pouvoir jouer. Videz votre main en premier pour gagner la manche.","Lege einen Stein an, der zu einem offenen Ende der Reihe passt, und ziehe aus dem Vorrat, bis du kannst. Wer zuerst alle Steine los ist, gewinnt die Runde.","Jogue uma pedra que combine com uma ponta aberta da linha e compre do monte at\xe9 conseguir. Acabe com suas pedras primeiro para vencer a rodada.","\u5217\u306e\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306b\u5408\u3046\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u3001\u51fa\u305b\u308b\u307e\u3067\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306b\u624b\u724c\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u5207\u308b\u3068\u30e9\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0932 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0915 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u092f\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u0938\u0947 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0924\u094d\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0902\u0921 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Mainkan kartu yang cocok dengan ujung terbuka barisan, dan tarik dari tumpukan sampai bisa main. Habiskan kartumu lebih dulu untuk memenangkan ronde.","\u0110\u1eb7t qu\xe2n kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf c\u1ee7a h\xe0ng, v\xe0 b\u1ed1c t\u1eeb kho cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. \u0110\xe1nh h\u1ebft qu\xe2n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng v\xf2ng."],t.s)
B.aqc=s(["Domin\xf3 de construir trenes","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on construit des trains","Domino mit Z\xfcgen","Domin\xf3 de montar trens","\u5217\u8eca\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino membangun kereta","Domino x\u1ebfp t\xe0u"],t.s)
B.akE=s(["Construye tu propio tren desde el doble central o juega en el Tren Mexicano compartido. Si no puedes jugar, roba, y tu tren queda abierto para todos.","Construisez votre propre train \xe0 partir du double central, ou jouez sur le Train mexicain commun. Si vous ne pouvez pas jouer, piochez, et votre train s\u2019ouvre \xe0 tous.","Baue deinen eigenen Zug vom Doppelstein in der Mitte aus oder lege an den gemeinsamen Mexican Train an. Kannst du nicht legen, ziehst du, und dein Zug steht allen offen.","Monte seu pr\xf3prio trem a partir do duplo central ou jogue no Trem Mexicano compartilhado. Se n\xe3o puder jogar, compre, e seu trem fica aberto para todos.","\u4e2d\u592e\u306e\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u304b\u3089\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5217\u8eca\u3092\u3064\u306a\u3050\u304b\u3001\u5171\u6709\u306e\u30e1\u30ad\u30b7\u30ab\u30f3\u30c8\u30ec\u30a4\u30f3\u306b\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5217\u8eca\u304c\u5168\u54e1\u306b\u958b\u653e\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092c\u0940\u091a \u0915\u0947 \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0901, \u092f\u093e \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e \u092e\u0948\u0915\u094d\u0938\u093f\u0915\u0928 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902, \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928 \u0938\u092c\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0916\u0941\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964","Bangun keretamu sendiri dari balak di tengah, atau main di Kereta Meksiko bersama. Jika tidak bisa main, tarik kartu, dan keretamu terbuka untuk semua.","X\u1ebfp t\xe0u c\u1ee7a ri\xeang b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i \u1edf gi\u1eefa, ho\u1eb7c \u0111i v\xe0o T\xe0u Mexico chung. N\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, h\xe3y b\u1ed1c qu\xe2n, v\xe0 t\xe0u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1edf cho m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi."],t.s)
B.a6B=s(["Domin\xf3 de puntuar de cinco en cinco","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on marque par cinq","Domino mit F\xfcnferwertung","Domin\xf3 de pontuar de cinco em cinco","5\u306e\u500d\u6570\u3067\u5f97\u70b9\u3059\u308b\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a-\u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino skor kelipatan lima","Domino t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u1ed9i s\u1ed1 n\u0103m"],t.s)
B.a7p=s(["Punt\xfaa cada vez que los extremos abiertos sumen un m\xfaltiplo de cinco. El primer doble se abre en cuatro direcciones. Llega primero a la puntuaci\xf3n objetivo para ganar.","Marquez chaque fois que les bouts libres totalisent un multiple de cinq. Le premier double s\u2019ouvre dans quatre directions. Atteignez le score vis\xe9 en premier pour gagner.","Punkte gibt es, wenn die offenen Enden zusammen ein Vielfaches von f\xfcnf ergeben. Der erste Doppelstein \xf6ffnet in vier Richtungen. Wer zuerst die Zielpunktzahl erreicht, gewinnt.","Pontue sempre que as pontas abertas somarem um m\xfaltiplo de cinco. O primeiro duplo se abre em quatro dire\xe7\xf5es. Chegue primeiro \xe0 pontua\xe7\xe3o-alvo para vencer.","\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u7aef\u306e\u5408\u8a08\u304c5\u306e\u500d\u6570\u306b\u306a\u308b\u305f\u3073\u306b\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306e\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u306f4\u65b9\u5411\u306b\u4f38\u3070\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5148\u306b\u76ee\u6a19\u70b9\u306b\u9054\u3057\u305f\u4eba\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u091c\u092c \u092d\u0940 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c \u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0915\u093e \u0917\u0941\u0923\u091c \u0939\u094b, \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0901\u0964 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u091a\u093e\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0913\u0930 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a\u0915\u0930 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dapatkan skor setiap kali ujung-ujung terbuka berjumlah kelipatan lima. Balak pertama terbuka ke empat arah. Capai skor target lebih dulu untuk menang.","Ghi \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ed7i khi t\u1ed5ng c\xe1c \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1edf l\xe0 b\u1ed9i s\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a n\u0103m. Qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean m\u1edf ra b\u1ed1n h\u01b0\u1edbng. V\u1ec1 \u0111\xedch \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ee5c ti\xeau tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng."],t.s)
B.adg=s(["Domin\xf3 de puntuar con extremos iguales","Dominos o\xf9 l\u2019on marque avec des bouts \xe9gaux","Domino mit Wertung f\xfcr gleiche Enden","Domin\xf3 de pontuar com pontas iguais","\u4e21\u7aef\u304c\u305d\u308d\u3046\u3068\u5f97\u70b9\u3059\u308b\u30c9\u30df\u30ce","\u090f\u0915 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b","Domino skor ujung yang sama","Domino t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m khi hai \u0111\u1ea7u gi\u1ed1ng nhau"],t.s)
B.add=s(["Punt\xfaa cuando los dos extremos de la l\xednea muestren el mismo n\xfamero, y m\xe1s si un doble hace que sean tres. Roba si no puedes jugar. Llega primero a la puntuaci\xf3n objetivo para ganar.","Marquez quand les deux bouts de la ligne montrent le m\xeame nombre, et davantage quand un double en fait trois. Piochez si vous ne pouvez pas jouer. Atteignez le score vis\xe9 en premier pour gagner.","Punkte gibt es, wenn beide Enden der Reihe dieselbe Zahl zeigen, und mehr, wenn ein Doppelstein daraus drei macht. Ziehe, wenn du nicht legen kannst. Wer zuerst die Zielpunktzahl erreicht, gewinnt.","Pontue quando as duas pontas da linha mostrarem o mesmo n\xfamero, e mais quando um duplo fizer tr\xeas. Compre se n\xe3o puder jogar. Chegue primeiro \xe0 pontua\xe7\xe3o-alvo para vencer.","\u5217\u306e\u4e21\u7aef\u304c\u540c\u3058\u6570\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3068\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u3001\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u30673\u3064\u305d\u308d\u3046\u3068\u3055\u3089\u306b\u5f97\u70b9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u51fa\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u306f\u5c71\u304b\u3089\u5f15\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5148\u306b\u76ee\u6a19\u70b9\u306b\u9054\u3057\u305f\u4eba\u306e\u52dd\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u091c\u092c \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u0905\u0902\u0915 \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0901, \u0914\u0930 \u0921\u092c\u0932 \u0938\u0947 \u0924\u0940\u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0924\u094b \u0914\u0930 \u091c\u093c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0926\u093e\u0964 \u091a\u093e\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u0924\u094b \u091f\u093e\u0907\u0932 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0939\u0941\u0901\u091a\u0915\u0930 \u091c\u0940\u0924\u0947\u0902\u0964","Dapatkan skor saat kedua ujung barisan menunjukkan angka yang sama, dan lebih banyak saat balak membuatnya jadi tiga. Tarik kartu jika tidak bisa main. Capai skor target lebih dulu untuk menang.","Ghi \u0111i\u1ec3m khi hai \u0111\u1ea7u h\xe0ng c\xf3 c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1, v\xe0 nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n khi qu\xe2n \u0111\xf4i l\xe0m th\xe0nh ba. B\u1ed1c qu\xe2n n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. V\u1ec1 \u0111\xedch \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1ee5c ti\xeau tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eafng."],t.s)
B.atm=new A.bI(["T-G-Apps Game Catalog",B.ajv,"Visual HTML version: 2026-10-01A",B.afy,"Three apps and eighteen games: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard.",B.acE,"Six classic card games in one app, from partnership trick-taking and contract play to draw-and-discard and pegging. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.a6_,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage.",B.af_,"6 games",B.aiY,"Visual HTML version: 2026-09-30A",B.amE,"Three apps and twenty games: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard.",B.a6p,"In Every T-G-Apps Game",B.ahq,"Robot players.",B.af4,"Fill any seat with a robot. Every game\u2019s robots play real strategy, not random moves, so a table is ready whenever you are \u2014 alone or with friends.",B.anx,"Hint system.",B.aci,"Not sure what to do? Tap Hint for the play the robots would make and the reason behind it. It is the fastest way to learn a new game or sharpen your strategy.",B.aor,"Multi-lingual.",B.ai5,"Every game, menu and rule book is available in English, Spanish, French, German, Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, Hindi, Indonesian and Vietnamese. Switch languages at any time.",B.a63,"Multiphone play.",B.ao9,"Play together on your own phones: one phone creates a room and shares a six-character code, and friends join from wherever they are. Each phone sees only its own cards.",B.aoc,"Audience Policy",B.rG,u.C,B.rJ,"T-G-Apps Casino",B.ac4,"Casino card games",B.aj_,"Eight casino favorites in one app: blackjack, four kinds of poker, and three house-banked table games. Every table plays with simulated chips and a bankroll that carries from hand to hand, so you can practice strategy, try a new game, or just enjoy a night at the tables without spending real money.",B.an3,"Games: 21, Texas Hold'em, 7 Card Draw, 7 Card Stud, 5 Card Draw, Baccarat, Let It Ride, Caribbean Stud.",B.a6E,"Ages 13+",B.rI,"Simulated betting",B.ru,"8 games",B.akD,"21",B.a9n,"Blackjack",B.aqQ,"Classic blackjack against the dealer, with hit, stand, double, split, surrender and insurance, and configurable table rules. The hint shows the basic-strategy play for every hand.",B.amV,"During a hand",B.aif,"Game menu",B.agD,"Showdown",B.amL,"Texas Hold'em",B.a5a,"Community-card poker",B.agI,"Two hole cards, five community cards and four betting rounds, in no-limit, pot-limit or fixed-limit play, with blinds and optional antes.",B.afJ,"7 Card Draw",B.a9b,"Draw poker",B.ady,"Seven private cards, a round of betting, one draw to improve, and the best five cards win.",B.a5w,"7 Card Stud",B.a8Q,"Stud poker",B.aeY,"Fixed-limit seven-card stud with antes, a bring-in, and a mix of face-down and face-up cards dealt across five streets.",B.ach,"5 Card Draw",B.aj9,"The classic: ante up, bet, draw up to three new cards, bet again and show down.",B.akc,"Baccarat",B.ajR,"Punto banco",B.a5j,"Bet on the Player, the Banker or a Tie, then watch the cards follow the traditional third-card rules. Six- or eight-deck shoes, with or without the banker commission.",B.ajT,"Let It Ride",B.aj2,"Table poker against the pay table",B.ak_,"Place three equal bets, see three cards, and pull back up to two bets as the two community cards are revealed. A pair of tens or better pays, up to 1,000 to 1 for a royal flush.",B.a8q,"Caribbean Stud",B.aeF,"Table poker against the dealer",B.a78,"Ante, look at five cards and one dealer card, then fold or raise. The dealer must qualify with ace-king or better, and big hands pay up to 100 to 1 on the raise.",B.aaJ,"T-G-Apps House of Cards",B.aho,"Classic card games",B.ajm,"Eight of the world\u2019s best-loved card games at one table: trick-taking games for partners and for going it alone, and the great melding games. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.aed,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage, Pinochle, Canasta, Euchre.",B.an1,"Children &amp; Adults",B.rA,"No wagering",B.rO,"Hearts",B.abU,"Trick-taking",B.a9x,"Pass three cards, then avoid taking hearts and the queen of spades \u2014 unless you can take them all and shoot the moon.",B.ahm,"Spades",B.aaz,"Partnership trick-taking",B.ais,"Bid the tricks you and your partner will take, with spades always trump. Watch your bags, and go nil when the cards are right.",B.amP,"Bridge",B.a5X,"Contract bridge",B.a8_,"Bid to a contract with your partner, then declare or defend with the dummy face up on the table. Played in sets of four deals with rotating vulnerability.",B.ada,"Rummy",B.ag0,"Draw and discard",B.aim,"Draw, meld sets and runs, lay off on the table, and be first to go out while your opponents are caught holding cards.",B.ajb,"Cribbage",B.abW,"Pegging and counting",B.ani,"Discard to the crib, peg to fifteen and thirty-one, then count fifteens, pairs, runs, flushes and nobs in the show. First to 121 wins.",B.aqZ,"Pinochle",B.agi,"Partnership bidding and meld",B.ac7,"Bid for trump, show your meld \u2014 marriages, runs, pinochles and arounds \u2014 then win the counters in the tricks to make your bid.",B.abK,"Canasta",B.adO,"Partnership melding",B.anW,"Draw, take the pile, and build melds of the same rank with your partner. Seven cards make a canasta; wild cards and red threes change everything.",B.ajl,"Euchre",B.a9q,"A fast five-card game: order up or call trump, remember the bowers, and take three tricks \u2014 or go alone for all five.",B.a75,"T-G-Apps Boneyard",B.a8f,"Dice and tile games",B.aeS,"Dice and tiles for every age: two dice games, a full set of dominoes, and six ways to play mahjong. Shake, draw from the boneyard, or build a winning hand, against the robots or friends and family on their own phones.",B.ab1,"Games: YZ, Farkle, Dominoes, Mahjong.",B.ara,"4 games",B.abT,"YZ",B.a5f,"Dice scorecard strategy",B.rE,"Roll five dice up to three times a turn and choose where to score: the upper section, three and four of a kind, full houses, straights and five of a kind.",B.aem,"Farkle",B.ac8,"Push-your-luck dice",B.a6b,"Set aside scoring dice and keep rolling to build your turn total \u2014 but roll nothing that scores and you farkle and lose it all. First to 10,000 wins.",B.a5Z,"Dominoes",B.aiq,"Domino tile games",B.ab7,"Mahjong",B.ab_,"Mahjong tile games",B.af5,"Six ways to play: Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan and Solitaire, with calls for pungs, kongs and chows and each style\u2019s own scoring.",B.aiU,u.q,B.rw,"Skip to catalog",B.ael,"Card, Dice &amp; Tile Games",B.ahk,"Explore T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards and T-G-Apps Boneyard. Dice Games, Rummy, Dominoes and Mahjong open menus of related games.",B.a4V,"Casino",B.apP,"House of Cards",B.anb,"Boneyard",B.apL,"Player 1, who sets up the game, is always a human; fill any other seat with a robot. Players on other phones are always human. Every game&rsquo;s robots play real strategy, not random moves, so a table is ready whenever you are &mdash; alone or with friends.",B.ae_,"Casino Games and Local Laws",B.ajX,"Our casino games use simulated chips. They do not offer real-money gambling, prizes of real-world value, or cash-out.",B.ait,"Availability varies by location:",B.a9S,"simulated gambling can be restricted in some countries even when no real money can be won. Local laws and age requirements may apply.",B.a7a,"House of Cards and Boneyard feature non-wagering card, dice and tile games for children and adults.",B.aqP,"Subject to local age restrictions",B.afC,"Classic card games and a Rummy game menu in one app, from partnership trick-taking, contract play and meld to draw-and-discard, canastas and pegging. Play a quick hand or a full game to the target score, learn the rules as you go, and let the robots fill any empty seat.",B.aqg,"Games: Hearts, Spades, Euchre, Bridge, Rummy, Cribbage, Pinochle, Canasta.",B.aog,"8 game entries, including the Rummy menu",B.ak2,"Rummy game collection",B.amw,"Rummy is a game-selection menu.",B.aqn,"Open it to choose among related rummy games, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.ab2,"Dice Games",B.afZ,"Dice game collection",B.anv,"Dice Games is a game-selection menu.",B.ad5,"Open it to choose YZ or Farkle, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.ak4,"3 game menus",B.acS,"Menu of related games",B.anZ,"Bidding, meld and tricks",B.afw,"Bid for the right to name trump, show your meld &mdash; marriages, runs, pinochles and arounds &mdash; then take tricks to win the counters. Partners must make the bid or go set. First team to 1500 wins.",B.ahO,"Hand recap",B.aq1,"Partnership draw, meld and canastas",B.acZ,"Draw from the stock or take the whole discard pile, meld sets of the same rank with your partner, and build canastas &mdash; melds of seven cards. Wild cards help, but they freeze the pile. First team to 5000 wins.",B.abo,"Domino game collection",B.aoQ,"Dominoes is a game-selection menu.",B.aqt,"Mahjong game collection",B.aoj,"Mahjong is a game-selection menu.",B.alL,"Choose Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan or Solitaire. Each selection opens its own game and rules.",B.a4Q,"Back to top",B.aiy,"Visual HTML version: 2026-10-12B",B.a9L,"Our 3 Apps",B.aaG,"Each app has its own games. Tap a name to jump to it.",B.a5v,"Six domino games in one: 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives and Bergen \u2014 bid and take tricks in 42; in the others, match the open ends, draw from the boneyard when you are stuck, and be first to play out your hand.",B.aoq,"Choose 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives or Bergen, then start that game with its own rules.",B.aca,"42",B.alh,"Block",B.aal,"Draw",B.ap_,"Mexican Train",B.a6z,"All Fives",B.a7j,"Bergen",B.ark,"Hong Kong",B.aeD,"Riichi",B.afe,"Chinese Official",B.ahj,"Taiwanese",B.a7e,"Sichuan",B.aqH,"Solitaire",B.agg,"Gin Rummy",B.alm,"Rummy 500",B.a5M,"Contract Rummy",B.amh,"Indian Rummy",B.a5O,"Open it to choose 42, Block, Draw, Mexican Train, All Fives or Bergen, each with its own rules. The screenshots below show the menu and each game in it.",B.a8U,"Texas trick-taking dominoes",B.afu,"Two teams of two bid on each hand, the high bidder names trumps, and the count tiles are worth extra points. Make your bid to win a mark.",B.amv,"Classic match-the-ends dominoes",B.aiM,"Play a tile that matches an open end of the line. There is no drawing: if you cannot play, you pass. Play out your hand first to win the round.",B.agB,"Match-the-ends dominoes with drawing",B.ajj,"Play a tile that matches an open end of the line, and draw from the boneyard until you can. Play out your hand first to win the round.",B.akI,"Train-building dominoes",B.aqc,"Build your own train out from the hub double, or play on the shared Mexican Train. If you cannot play, draw, and your train opens to everyone.",B.akE,"Score-by-fives dominoes",B.a6B,"Score whenever the open ends of the layout add up to a multiple of five. The first double opens four ways. Reach the target score first to win.",B.a7p,"Matching-ends scoring dominoes",B.adg,"Score when both ends of the line show the same number, and more when a double makes three. Draw when you cannot play. Reach the target score first to win.",B.add],A.a5("bI<q,O<q>>"))
